  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods Programme Zimbabwe - Seke Rural Home-Based Care Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Improved capacity of 37,000 households to produce or acquire sufficient food through improved agricultural practices or where necessary, targeted household rations
2. Improved and sustained access to safe water and sanitation by 10,000 vulnerable households
3. Improved access to care and support for 10,000 HIV affected households through HBC and mainstreaming.
4. Enhanced information sharing and dissemination.
5. Programme impact assessed and documented</narrative>
  </description>
